# Hadley, 2026-09-03. Record 0018 gives a literal the type it has when nothing
# asks -- an i32, an f64 -- and being asked to be that costs nothing while
# being asked to be anything else costs a step. It is the same integer rule 5
# already ranks by, over the default instead of over an inheritance chain.
#
# It is a tie break and never a filter, which is what the three shapes here
# are for: the default among the candidates wins, the default absent from them
# decides nothing, and two candidates equally far from it still tie.

def take : void
    @a : u8
    pass

def take : void
    @a : i32
    pass

# neither of these is what a literal is when nothing asks
def hold : void
    @a : u8
    pass

def hold : void
    @a : i64
    pass

def reach : void
    @a : u16
    pass

def reach : void
    @a : i64
    pass

def main : i32
    # '3' fits both, and the i32 is the default: an ambiguous call until
    # 2026-09-03 and now the i32
    take(3)

    # '300' fits only one of them, and the ranking never got to speak
    take(300)

    # the default is neither candidate, so it filters nothing out: '300' does
    # not fit a u8 and the i64 takes it, one step from the default
    hold(300)

    # and two candidates one step away are still tied, which is record 0012's
    # ambiguous call. The tie break only breaks a tie the default is in
    reach(3)
    return 0
